  "reason": "The current best (config_031: multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, resnet50, avgpool, weighted, acc=0.678) establishes a clear winning direction. However, the image encoder dimension is completely unexplored—only resnet50 has been tested. Config_037 changes exactly one variable (resnet50 → imagenet_vit_l) while holding all other settings at their proven-best values (scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool, weighted). This cleanly isolates the image encoder effect: if accuracy improves, the image modality is a bottleneck and a stronger visual representation unlocks further gains; if it does not, resnet50 is sufficient and the image contribution has plateaued. This is the highest-value single-variable test because it extends the current best along an untested axis, maintains the exploitation of the strong scvi+weighted+avgpool evidence, and directly informs whether further investment in the image branch is warranted under the limited budget."
}

